  "folds_detail": "P1: StratifiedKFold(3) on rows, seed 0. P1b: train on 2016 weeks, test on 2017 weeks. P2: StratifiedGroupKFold(3) by building_id, seeds [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]; mean and sd over seeds, confidence interval is the mean of the per-seed bounds. P3: leave-one-site-out over 18 test sites (Bear, Bobcat, Bull, Cockatoo, Crow, Eagle, Fox, Gator, Hog, Lamb, Moose, Mouse, Panther, Peacock, Rat, Robin, Shrew, Wolf); sites with fewer than 5 sampled buildings (none) are always in training and never tested. P2 and P3 refit the tercile cutoffs on each fold's training buildings; P1 and P1b use the table label. Building-level scores average class probabilities over a building's test weeks; interval is a 95% percentile bootstrap over buildings (1000 resamples).",
  "notes": [
    "30,000-row random sample (seed 42) of the 100,000-row table; rows of one building share a label.",
